{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389360/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker_15__1_.gif?t=1758991611\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I'm Kazfiel Balthioul Tabbris.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short, <strong>Kaz!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the game where being an asshole to your friends <strong>is actually a good thing!</strong>\u00a0In Haphazard Angel, 2-4 players take on the hilariously challenging task of controlling a single, magnificent <i>(and often unwieldy)</i> angel. You each control one of its four glorious wings, meaning teamwork is essential... <strong>until it isn't.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Demo contains [ARCADE MODE]</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperating is a must - </strong>Kaz can't get anywhere with one wing. Collecting halos can get Kaz back to heaven!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competing is inevitable\u00a0</strong>- Only one wing can pick up halos and evil essences. The more each player picks up, the stronger their influence over Kazfiel gets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains 60 sets of obstacles, content up to level 20, and one boss fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode and more Arcade mode content will be in available in the base game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The controls are simple:</strong> flap your wings, navigate the chaos, and work (or fight) with your teammates. Whether you\u2019re playing couch co-op or online, Haphazard Angel delivers the perfect mix of fun and frustration!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Quench Your Thirst","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389360/a5edc330fc5609af349d4d9dbe2ffdb27a94f85d.jpg"},{"name":"Brick by Brick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389360/fcc51988a47ba7a65b15995de9b1b2b6372775ac.jpg"},{"name":"No Room In Heaven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389360/df3d0db822f5a1f4744244ae26816d488b1ab1d3.jpg"},{"name":"Surge of Power!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389360/9c2992ab8535949bcbab07c3d720bbfdc588cac1.jpg"},{"name":"Okaeri, Maou-sama","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389360/47682553c72dce19ec4b57d04804300aa56765b6.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome back, Kazfiel. You've made some new friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389360/81453ba4ad480d97abc34bb1488865b8d5fade29.jpg"},{"name":"Teamwork makes the dream work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389360/a441a3fbbe87b1d5bb7a5d741ae2b726b7862aa5.jpg"},{"name":"It's all downhill from here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389360/87a83cd85b37f706909f2157bd11e86e8ede73d2.jpg"},{"name":"That's it, I'm calling my strongest soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389360/5b97acd0f59cbe83d2e5eb543802ed7c7ba870d6.jpg"},{"name":"How are you still alive?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389360/41a91bfb4b5c71ebeab98c30a85c5b16cd71149c.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3389360?t=1758991611","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758991611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389360/46545453ea859b5b61f3da314212595063dd4111/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758991611","capsule_imagev5":"ht