essences. The more each player picks up, the stronger their influence over Kazfiel gets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains 60 sets of obstacles, content up to level 20, and one boss fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode and more Arcade mode content will be in available in the base game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The controls are simple:</strong> flap your wings, navigate the chaos, and work (or fight) with your teammates. Whether you\u2019re playing couch co-op or online, Haphazard Angel delivers the perfect mix of fun and frustration!</p>","developers":["Capriccioso Games Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2363160","name":"Haphazard Angel"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389360/420d270b44683753edfc282f13c32236e894dd1d/header.jpg?t=1758991611","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3389360/1381614322/0785942f818a63e12bc6f061a66fe1f2c2127804/1758710232/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758905773","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3389360/1381614322/0785942f818a63e12bc6f061a66fe1f2c2127804/1758710232/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758905773","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3389360/1381614322/0785942f818a63e12bc6f061a66fe1f2c2127804/1758710232/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758905773","id":257085414,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085414/movie